sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User
    participant Streamlit as 🌐 Streamlit App
    participant Preproc as 🔧 Preprocessing
    participant TFIDF as 📌 TF-IDF
    participant Embed as 📎 Embeddings
    participant BART as ✨ BART Model
    participant ROUGE as 📊 ROUGE Evaluator

    Note over User,ROUGE: ENTIRE SUMMARIZATION WORKFLOW

    User->>Streamlit: Enter article text
    User->>Streamlit: Select model (Extractive/Abstractive/Compare)

    alt Extractive Path
        Streamlit->>Preproc: Call preprocessing
        Preproc-->>Streamlit: Return cleaned text

        Streamlit->>TFIDF: Calculate sentence scores
        TFIDF-->>Streamlit: TF-IDF scores

        Streamlit->>Embed: Compute similarities
        Embed-->>Streamlit: Embedding scores

        Streamlit->>Streamlit: Combine (50% each)
        Streamlit->>Streamlit: Select top-K sentences
        Streamlit-->>User: Display Extractive Summary

    else Abstractive Path
        Streamlit->>Preproc: Call preprocessing
        Preproc-->>Streamlit: Return cleaned text

        Streamlit->>BART: Tokenize + Encode
        BART-->>Streamlit: Context embeddings

        Streamlit->>BART: Beam search generation
        loop 4 Beams
            BART->>BART: Expand top tokens
            BART->>BART: Apply length penalty
            BART->>BART: Block repeated n-grams
        end
        BART-->>Streamlit: Generated token IDs

        Streamlit->>BART: Decode tokens
        BART-->>Streamlit: Summary text
        Streamlit-->>User: Display Abstractive Summary

    end

    alt ROUGE Evaluation
        User->>Streamlit: Enter reference summary
        User->>Streamlit: Click "Evaluate"

        Streamlit->>ROUGE: Compute ROUGE-1/2/L
        ROUGE->>ROUGE: Tokenize + Stem
        ROUGE->>ROUGE: Count n-gram overlap
        ROUGE->>ROUGE: Calculate F-measure
        ROUGE-->>Streamlit: ROUGE scores

        Streamlit->>Streamlit: Compute compression ratio
        Streamlit-->>User: Display metrics dashboard
    end

    Note over User,ROUGE: Model comparison shows side-by-side results